#NEXUS

[ otero2015a_fig19: Time-calibrated sauropodiform tree, 19 tips, fully resolved; a pectinate ladder read from right-angle node bars (the image rotated to put the root on the left and node lines listed per column). Eusauropoda is an arrow tip. Random-sample case (seed 20261106); topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=19;
    TAXLABELS
        basalmost_sauropodomorphs
        Jingshanosaurus
        Yunnanosaurus
        Seitaad
        Anchisaurus
        Mussaurus
        Sefapanosaurus
        Aardonyx
        Leonerasaurus
